# Item effects (reports/engine/2026-11-19-item-effects) at night by the tavern: items of every kind of effect lying on
# the ground (potions, a rune, a stone, an amulet, the fire bow, Beliar's claw), then the claw and the fire bow carried,
# the claw drawn, the bow drawn. `itemfx` counts the live effects. Run it again with OPENGOTHIC_ITEM_EFFECTS=0 for
# «off | on», or with a content set of own particles (magic_fire_set.py fire_bow) for «the game's | ours».
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 22 0
overlay off
ui off
goto NW_TAVERNE_TROLLAREA_03
clear 3000
wait 3000
set time 22 0
watch player
item put ItPo_Health_01 140 -30
item put ItPo_Mana_01 140 -15
item put ItRu_FireBolt 140 0
item put ItMi_Addon_Stone_01 140 15
item put ItAm_Addon_Franco 140 30
item put ItRw_Addon_FireBow 200 -5
item put ItMw_BeliarWeapon_1H_01 200 15
wait 2500
itemfx
cam at 41990 3440 -470 41835 3335 -505
wait 1500
rec ground
wait 4000
stop
give ItMw_BeliarWeapon_1H_01
equip ItMw_BeliarWeapon_1H_01
give ItRw_Addon_FireBow
equip ItRw_Addon_FireBow
wait 1500
